text:
When your Life would be reduced by an opposing effect, instead of reducing your Life, you can activate this set card, ignoring the Burst condition.

{{burst|After an opposing Spirit/Ultimate's (When Summoned) effect resolves}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, you can pay two cost to summon one "Doll"-named Spirit card from your Hand/Trash.

{{Burst|After an opposing Spirit/Ultimate's (When Summoned) effect resolves}}
During this turn, all opposing LV1/LV2 Spirits and LV3/LV4 Ultimates can't attack. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3] (When Attacks/Blocks) You can reveal a card from your decktop. If that card is Cost 2/4, return an opposing Spirit/Ultimate to the deckbottom. Add the revealed card to your Hand.

{{sumcon|You control one or more Armed Machine Spirit/Ultimate}}

While you control any White-only Grandwalker Nexus, this set card is unaffected by opposing effects.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
Return two opposing Spirits/Ultimates to the deck, one to the top and one to the bottom. After this effect resolves, summon this card, ignoring the summon condition and without paying the cost.

[LV4][LV5] (When Blocks)
At the end of battle, refresh this Ultimate. Also, send an opposing Life to the Reserve.

Flash- (Either Attack Step) You can summon this card from your Removed Zone. When you've done so, banish a total of four Red/Purple/White/facedown cards from the opposing Trash/Removed Zone.

Flash- {{Accel|Cost 2 ()}}
Return a Brave on an opposing battling Spirit/Ultimate/Grandwalker Nexus to the Hand. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up on your Removed Zone.

{{sumcon|Your Life is at two or more}}

[LV3][LV4] (When Attacks)
By discarding two face-up cards from the opposing Removed Zone, destroy an opposing Cost 8 or less Spirit. If you control a Saga Brave, this "Cost Destruction effect" can ignore the cost of Braves.

While this card is in the Removed Zone, every opposing Spirit/Ultimate gets -1000 BP.

Flash - {{Accel|Cost 3 ()}}
During this battle, the symbol of an opposing Grandwalker Nexus becomes zero. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.

Flash -  {{Grand Advent|Armored Dragon & Cost 5 or more|(Either Attack Step)}}
By either sending your  to the Trash, or putting a core from your Grandwalker Nexus to a Spirit you control, stack this from the Hand onto your target Spirit.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] (When Advents/Attacks)
By returning an opposing Spirit/Burst to the Hand, this Spirit refreshes. This effect can only be prevented by "remain on Field" effects.

[LV3] {{ha|Red/White/Yellow/Blue}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Red/White/Yellow/Blue Spirit/Brave/Nexus/Magic effects.

Unless you banish a Spirit card from your Hand, this card can't be summoned.

Flash - {{Accel|Cost 3 ()}}
Send three cores from an opposing Grandwalker Nexus to the Void. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto your Removed Zone.
